      "id": "p1-statement",
      "format": "image",
      "media": ["p1-statement/slide-01.jpg"],
      "caption": "Businesses can spend thousands on websites that still feel generic. We believe they deserve better.\n\nSolace is a creative and digital studio: web design and development, photography, video and the growth work that keeps a business's digital presence moving. Modern tools, human creative direction, built around the business behind it.\n\nSee the studio at solaceproduction.com\n\n#webdesign #webdevelopment #creativestudio #smallbusinesswebsite #digitalstudio",
      "alt": ["Statement on a white background: Businesses can spend thousands on websites that still feel outdated, generic or disconnected. We believe businesses deserve better. Solace, creative and digital studio."],
      "targets": [{"account": "main"}],
      "checklist": ["Paste the alt text", "Confirm the link in the bio points to solaceproduction.com"]
    },
    {
      "id": "p5-what-we-do",
      "format": "carousel",
      "media": ["p5-what-we-do/slide-01.jpg","p5-what-we-do/slide-02.jpg","p5-what-we-do/slide-03.jpg","p5-what-we-do/slide-04.jpg","p5-what-we-do/slide-05.jpg"],
      "caption": "Digital, Creative, Growth: how Solace works with a business, in three parts.\n\nSwipe for what each one covers: web design and development, photography and video, and the SEO and website management that keep a site working after launch.\n\nKnow a business owner who deserves a better website? Send this to them.\n\n#webdesign #photography #seo #creativestudio #smallbusinesswebsite",
      "alt": [
        "Cover on dark blue: What we do. Digital. Creative. Growth. A creative and digital studio.",
        "Digital: websites designed around how your customers actually decide, then built to be fast, accessible and easy to run. Web design, web development, digital experiences.",
        "Creative: the photos, video and visual direction that make a business look like itself, made for the web from the start. Creative direction, photography, videography, visual content.",
        "Growth: what happens after launch, being found, keeping the site current and improving it as the business changes. SEO foundations, website management, digital strategy, ongoing optimization.",
        "Know a business that deserves a better website? Send this to them. Start a project, solaceproduction.com."
      ],
      "targets": [{"account": "main"}],
      "checklist": ["Paste the alt text per slide"]
    },
    {
      "id": "p6-after-launch",
      "format": "carousel",
      "media": ["p6-after-launch/slide-01.jpg","p6-after-launch/slide-02.jpg","p6-after-launch/slide-03.jpg","p6-after-launch/slide-04.jpg","p6-after-launch/slide-05.jpg"],
      "caption": "Launching a website isn't where the work has to end.\n\nSolace website management covers hosting, security and backups, plus the small updates that come up all the time: hours, prices, menus, photos. You run the business. We take care of the website.\n\nBigger changes like redesigns or new pages get a separate quote first. Save this for when you're deciding who looks after your site.\n\n#websitemanagement #webdesign #smallbusiness #websitemaintenance #creativestudio",
      "alt": [
        "Cover on light grey: Website management. Launching isn't where it ends.",
        "You run the business. We take care of the website.",
        "Kept running, so it never goes down: hosting, SSL and security, backups, maintenance, technical support, performance monitoring.",
        "Kept current, so it always matches the business: hours updates, price updates, service and menu updates, photo replacements, small text changes, minor content changes.",
        "Bigger changes: redesigns, new pages or major functionality get a separate quote before any work begins. Start a project, solaceproduction.com."
      ],
      "targets": [{"account": "main"}],
